      <section class="article-section">
        <h2>The 2.28 vs 2.86 Fitment Factor Debate: Detailed Comparison</h2>
        <p>
          The core debate regarding the 8th Pay Commission centers on the divergence between the staff confederation demand of <strong>2.86</strong> and the working economic estimate of <strong>2.28</strong>:
        </p>

        <div class="comparison-grid">
