            <p><strong>Level 6 Entry Basic:</strong> ₹80,712 / month</p>
            <p><strong>Macroeconomic Rationale:</strong> Incorporates 53%–55% DA absorption while adding a real wage increase of approximately 25% to 30%. This balances the central fiscal deficit while shielding employee purchasing power.</p>
            <span class="comp-note">Considered the most realistic target for Cabinet approval.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="comparison-card demanded">
            <h4>The 2.86 Staff Side Maximum Demand</h4>
