            <p><strong>Level 6 Entry Basic:</strong> ₹1,01,244 / month</p>
            <p><strong>Macroeconomic Rationale:</strong> Based on the 15th Indian Labour Conference (ILC) recommendations and Dr. Aykroyd's minimum physiological food basket, adjusted for contemporary retail prices, clothing, housing, and children's education.</p>
            <span class="comp-note">Pushed strongly by railway, defence, and postal federations.</span>
          </div>
